      "pge:15852"
    ],
    "notes": "Both CDI (Balsamar)and Izcacuyo beaches are proper to land when the tide is at least halfway out. Be sure to check your tides to be on the proper timeframes.  Izcacuyo, although shorter and more technical, is most immediate to the launch, if a great deal of altitude is lost at the start, it is recommended to land here.\r\n\r\nBoth landings are privately owned.  Please contact  â€œLos Zopilotosâ€ to ensure a better experience.\r\n\r\n*landing* : 1- CDI 850 mts              13Â°30'3.3'N; 89Â°32'435.5'W - Elevation : 0m\r\n                   \r\n2 -   Izcacuyo 662mts     13Â°29'46.96'N; 89Â°31'49.43'W - Elevation : 0 m",
    "url": "https://www.paraglidingearth.com/?site=15852"
  },
